/* 
 * The idea is that whitney and co will force you to play a game, where depending on the size of  the next fish you catch, either whitney or one of their 
 * 	friends gets to have a turn with you. You can attempt to nudge the outcome after you catch a fish. If you fail to catch a fish twice, you get thrown in.
 *  After the betting game is over, the gang might leave, but they might not. Or you can try to get whitney to kick all of them out so it's just the two of you.
 *  After that, I was going to go with idea of there be a holding state like there is with Robin in their room, where whitney is holding on to you while... you 
 *  fish, but the more I wrote the more stupid that felt, and also just the physicality of it doesn't make sense, imagine trying to fish while someone is holding  
 *  you. Now I need to figure out how to end this whole thing in a way that isn't whitney and the gang leaving after the betting game is over.  Really, I just 
 *  need to have writing done for what goes on while it's just you and whitney.
 *
 * Before the betting game starts, whitney and co are sitting around, messing around, fishing. I'd like to add some more little events where they bully you. They
 *  can already force you to kiss a fish, but I want more. Using small or large fish to make fun of your insecurities? Meh.
 */

:: Fishing Whitney Pier Init
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.age to 0>>
<<set $whitneyFishingSeen to true>>
<<run initFishingPier()>>

Whitney's already on the pier when you arrive, a case of hard cider cracked open beside <<nnpc_him "Whitney">>. Three of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends are spread out along the railing, rods hanging over the edge, cans in hand.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> glances over as you approach and grins. "Oi," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, loud enough that <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends look up. "Look what showed up," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, jerking <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> head towards your <<lewdness>>.
	<<fameexhibitionism 5>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> glances over as you approach.
	<br><br>
	"Took you long enough." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> nods toward the water. "Well? Let's get to it." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pops the tab on a fresh can and leans against the railing, fishing pole in hand.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<fishingRodIcon>><<link [[Start fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>

:: Fishing Pier Whitney Arrive
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.age to 0>>

You see Whitney walking up the pier with a case of cider, a couple of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends are trailing behind <<nnpc_him "Whitney">>, carrying fishing rods.

<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> spots you and grins, gesturing towards you <<lewdness>>, "<<if $whitneyromance is 1>>my<<else>>the<</if>> slut got all dressed up."<<fameexhibitionism 5>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<<else>>
	<<if $whitneyFishingSeen>>
		<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> drops the case beside you. "Didn't know <<if $whitneyromance is 1>>my<<else>>the<</if>> slut came out here." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> grabs a can from the case, looks like hard cider, and leans against the railing, one of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends handing <<nnpc_him "Whitney">> a fishing rod.
	<<else>>
		<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> drops the case, then grabs a can of hard cider from it and leans against the railing, one of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends handing <<nnpc_him "Whitney">> a fishing rod. "Move over, slut."
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<set $whitneyFishingSeen to true>>

<<link [[Continue fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Fishing Pier Whitney Bully Fisher Player Leave]]>><</link>>


/* Whitney proposes a bet on the size of the next fish caught, winner gets to have sex with PC */
:: Fishing Whitney Pier Bet
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "bet">>
<<set $fishing.whitney.betFails to 0>>

One of Whitney's friends tosses their rod aside and lets out a long, theatrical groan. "I'm bored." Whitney glances over at you, then back at <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends. "Yeah?" <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> tips back <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> cider. "I know what'll fix that."
<br><br>

<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stands, rolling <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> shoulders. "Alright. New game." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> saunters over until <<nnpc_he "Whitney">>'s right beside you, close enough that you can smell the alcohol on <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> breath. "Next fish you pull up, if it's a big one, I get to have some fun with you." A grin spreads across <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> face. "Small one, one of them gets the prize instead," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, jerking <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> thumb at one of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends.
<br><br>

<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> tilts <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> head back at you. "What do you think, slut?" You're pretty sure it doesn't matter what you think.
<br><br>

<<link [[Accept|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
<br>
<<if $whitneyromance>>
	<<link [[Decline|Fishing Whitney Decline Game No Fight]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Decline|Fishing Whitney Decline Game]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><</link>><<ldom>>
<</if>>


/* PC caught a big fish but tries to lie and claim it's small */
:: Fishing Whitney Pier Bet Lie Big
<<effects>>
<<if $englishSuccess is 1>>
	You hold the fish up, turning it in the light.
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"I'm... not sure this counts? It looks a bit small..."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Sorry, I don't see what's impressive about that." You tilt the fish. "That's not big."
	<<else>>
		"I don't know, this one looks kind of small to me."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Whitney's eyes narrow. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> leans in, studying the fish. A long pause.
	<br><br>

	"Hm." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> steps back and jerks <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> chin at <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends. <span class="green">"Alright, go on then."</span>
	<br><br>

	<<loadNPC 1 "fishing_date_friend1">><<person2>>
	The <<person>> perks up immediately, grinning like <<he>> wasn't expecting to win.
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Resist]]>><</link>>

<<else>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"I'm... not sure it counts? It looks kind of small..." <span class="red"> Your voice trails off under Whitney's stare.</span>
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Please. That's barely a fish." <span class="red">But your delivery lands flat, </span>and you know it.
	<<else>>
		"I don't know, this one looks kind of small to me." <span class="red">Your words don't come out as convincing as you'd like.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	Whitney stares at you. "Are you serious right now." It's not a question. <<npcincr Whitney love -2>><<llove>>
	<br><br>
	
	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> takes the fish from your hand, holds it up, and looks back at you with flat contempt. "Get over here."
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Resist]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><<gdom>><</link>>
<</if>>



/* PC caught a small fish but tries to lie and claim it's big using, either succeeding or failing */
:: Fishing Whitney Pier Bet Lie Small
<<effects>>
<<if $englishSuccess is 1>>
	You hold the fish up.
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"It's... actually not that small, I think? Probably bigger than average for this kind?"
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Please. I've seen way smaller. It's above average, easily."
	<<else>>
		"It's at least bigger than average."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	There's a beat of silence. Then the <<person2>><<person>> snorts. "Bigger than average." <<He>> glances at Whitney sideways. "I've heard <<nnpc_him "Whitney">> make that exact excuse before." <<He>> starts to laugh, then sees the expression on Whitney's face as Whitney stands up.
	<br><br>

	The punch <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> throws catches the <<person2>><<person>> square in the jaw, sending them stumbling sideways and spilling cider everywhere.
	<br><br>

	"Alright. The rest of you? Piss off." Whitney then turns back to you, the ghost of a smug smile on <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> face. "Well? Come here."
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex]]>><<npc Whitney>><<person1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<npcincr Whitney love 3>><</link>><<gglove>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Whitney Pier Won Resist]]>><<npcincr Whitney dom -2>><</link>><<lldom>>

<<else>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"It's... not that small, I think? " <span class="red">Your voice trails off uselessly.</span>
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"That's clearly above average." <span class="red">But the confidence doesn't reach your voice and you know it.</span>
	<<else>>
		"It's at least bigger than average." <span class="red">Your words don't come out as convincing as you'd like.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	"Stop." Whitney doesn't even look up. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> waves a hand at one of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends. "Go on."
	<br><br>
	
	The <<person2>><<person>> is already stepping toward you.
	<br><br>
	
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Whitney Pier Friend Won Resist]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


/* Consensual sex loop with Whitney after he wins the bet */
:: Fishing Whitney Pier Won Sex
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
