	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">><</link>>
<<elseif $finish is 1>> /* Asked to stop */
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"Sorry," you manage, getting your breath back.
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"I changed my mind," you say, steadying yourself.
	<<else>>
		"Sorry."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	"Yeah, yeah." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> waves a hand and pushes off the railing. "You owe me one, slut." <<npcincr Whitney love -1>><<llove>><<npcincr Whitney lust 1>><<glust>>
	<br><br>

	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> nods at <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends and they wander back over. The group settles back into their spots along the railing like nothing happened.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	Whitney stumbles back against the railing, catching <<nnpc_himself "Whitney">> with one hand.
	<<npcincr Whitney dom -1>><<ldom>>

	<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stares at you for a moment. "Fine." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> waves <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends off. They gather their things without a word and head off down the pier.
	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you catch your breath.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


